#   Table S6  step08_romania_common_years.csv
#   Figure 1  step03_fig1_identifiability       Figure 2  step06_fig2_simulation
#   Figure 3  step07_fig3_classical_vs_adjusted  Figure 4  step07_fig5_digit_effects
#   Figure S1 step05_fig_diagnostics            Figure S2 step07_figS1_age_range
#   Numbers quoted in the text: step06_summary_final.csv,
#   step08_units_summary.csv (test rejections, false discovery rate),
